{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\nThe .github cohort contains audited comments or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `.github/codeql/codeql-config.yml:1-10` — Preserve `docs/**` is excluded because it is non-shipping prose/experiments; default query suite unchanged. Consumer: CodeQL maintainers.\n- `.github/dependabot.yml:1-29` — Preserve PRs are advisory because Gerrit lands code; enabled ecosystems; major-version ignore and its removal condition. Consumer: Dependabot/GitHub maintainers.\n- `.github/pull_request_template.md:1-6` — Preserve at most a short hidden routing reminder. Consumer: GitHub PR form.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by the row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] Every consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by the row-by-row completion comment.\n- [ ] No executable behavior changes; verified by inspecting the final diff and running the command under Verification.\n- [ ] No test assertion changes; verified by inspecting the final diff.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule."}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788586652391081001,"uuid":"ff881fc8-cd29-4fbd-9b9c-0b6211e5da70"}